      "side": 1,
      "message": "It was my mistake. The PMIC_FAULT_L is asserted during power-on sequence when AP_RST_L and PS_HOLD is overridden. The power-off sequence is OK.\n\nFor example:\ndut-control warm_reset:on\ndut-control ec_uart_cmd:\"power off\" # Good to power-off.\ndut-control ec_uart_cmd:\"power on\"  # Failed to power-on. PMIC_FAULT_L asserted\ndut-control warm_reset:off\n\nI uploaded a new patch set to hold these pins until S5.",
